WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.520
Sometimes you may need to send a signature as part of your report.

2
00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:09.740
With Quickler, you can do that through Telegram or WhatsApp by using a photo.

3
00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:11.180
I'll show you how.

4
00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:17.300
First, press the camera button on the chat and then take a photo of something plain.

5
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:21.000
This could be your hand or a piece of clothing or the ground or

6
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.020
something like that.

7
00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:24.740
I'm taking a photo of the desk in this situation.

8
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:27.820
Then press the photo button.

9
00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:29.880
Once you've done that, select the pen.

10
00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.440
You'll see on WhatsApp the pen is in the top right.

11
00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.520
You can choose any colour you want.

12
00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:36.500
I'm going to go for bright green.

13
00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:39.560
And then write your signature.

14
00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:42.360
Once you've done that, press done.

15
00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:45.180
I should say the rotation that you send your signature in doesn't

16
00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:48.380
matter because Quickler will correct that for you.

17
00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:49.680
You don't have to say anything.

18
00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:53.740
It will be recognised as a signature, and you can go on with your check as normal.

19
00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:57.580
Or if you're just coming to the end, you can say done as usual.
